WEBVTT

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:38.030
One April morning
just after a rainfall...

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:41.600
Give us yer money!

00:01:41.710 --> 00:01:43.800
My name is
Hikaru Gosunkugi.

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:47.100
And I am on the verge of the
most dangerous time in my life!

00:01:47.210 --> 00:01:48.910
We may
look weird...

00:01:49.010 --> 00:01:51.000
But we're punks
with reputations!

00:01:51.110 --> 00:01:54.110
So unless you want us to
hurt you, hurry up and...

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:56.650
Give us everything
you've got!

00:01:56.850 --> 00:02:00.080
V-Very well.
Please, don't hit me...

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:01.690
Here's...

00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:04.230
everything I've got!

00:02:04.330 --> 00:02:05.690
Why you...!

00:02:05.800 --> 00:02:06.920
...sneaky little...!

00:02:07.030 --> 00:02:09.290
You got guts, geek!

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:10.890
Take this!

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:11.930
And some of that!

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:12.830
And a bit of the other!

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:14.100
Stop that!

00:02:14.340 --> 00:02:15.240
What the...!?

00:02:15.310 --> 00:02:17.170
Who're you?

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:22.200
Bullying that poor boy!
You must be delinquents!

00:02:22.310 --> 00:02:23.840
It's just a kid!

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:25.110
Scaring us like that...!

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:27.620
Take us on, and you'll regret it!

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:32.610
I'm Miss Hinako Ninomiya, and
I punish delinquents like you!

00:02:32.890 --> 00:02:33.650
Sounds like fun!

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:36.020
Let's go get punished!

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:41.490
Run for it!

00:02:55.650 --> 00:02:59.100
You boys are far too
young to take me on.

00:03:01.380 --> 00:03:05.180
If you're a man,
try acting a bit more dignified.

00:03:11.860 --> 00:03:15.190
I'm probably
dreaming all this!

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:28.040
Hello everybody! Today I
having big news for you all!

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:31.550
Start today you
having brand-new teacher.

00:03:31.650 --> 00:03:37.640
A real VIP! Already she
cleaning up 3 reform schools!

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:40.150
Furinkan isn't
a reform school!

00:03:40.260 --> 00:03:42.280
Yeah, but she's a
woman teacher!

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:47.230
The principal hired her,
so she's gotta be worthless!

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:49.360
Allow me to introduce...

00:03:49.470 --> 00:03:52.490
Miss Hinako Ninomiya!

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:59.130
I'm Miss Hinako Ninomiya!
You bad kids better watch out!

00:04:01.810 --> 00:04:03.510
W-What a cute teacher.

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:04.550
W-What...

00:04:05.150 --> 00:04:06.910
l-It's her!

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:08.850
What a haul!

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:10.040
Gimme back my gym shorts!

00:04:10.150 --> 00:04:11.980
You dirty old man!

00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:15.350
Who's old!? Can't you
see my school uniform?

00:04:15.460 --> 00:04:17.760
The old goat's at it again!

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:19.060
That old man never learns!

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:21.990
Nobody's stupid enough to
fall for the uniform trick!

00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:24.620
It's a delinquent student!

00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:28.370
Y-You idiot!

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:32.930
You old letch!

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:34.740
Take this!

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:36.900
She's cute...

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:39.280
...but she does
some dumb things!

00:04:40.150 --> 00:04:41.880
You had that
coming, you lecher!

00:04:41.990 --> 00:04:44.280
Don't underestimate us girls!

00:04:45.190 --> 00:04:47.380
W-Why, you!

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:53.560
Once again you interfere
with my life's simple joys!

00:04:54.800 --> 00:04:56.990
What an incredible
battle aura!

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:00.230
Outta the way, Teach.
Don't want you to get hurt.

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:04.740
It's a teacher's duty
to deal with bad students!

00:05:04.840 --> 00:05:06.540
Don't be stupid!

00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:09.040
C'mon! Be a good girl!

00:05:09.150 --> 00:05:11.840
Don't talk to your
teacher like that!

00:05:12.320 --> 00:05:15.720
Ranma!
You've gone too far!

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:19.090
Good Girl Exercise #1!

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:22.090
Malice! Evil!
Illness! Pain! Magic!

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:27.050
W-What's she doing!?

00:05:35.340 --> 00:05:36.460
W-What the...!?

00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:38.640
Behold, delinquent.

00:05:38.740 --> 00:05:40.830
The Anything-Goes Martial
Arts ultimate technique:

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:44.740
Good Girl Exercise #1,
Happo Five-yen Satsu!

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:49.180
"Anything-Goes Martial Arts"...!?

00:05:49.290 --> 00:05:51.850
She took him out
with a single attack!

00:05:51.960 --> 00:05:53.350
That technique is incredible!

00:05:53.460 --> 00:05:55.250
Miss Hinako, what's
your favorite food?

00:05:55.360 --> 00:05:56.880
Tell us your measurements.

00:05:56.990 --> 00:05:58.260
Your phone number?

00:05:58.360 --> 00:06:01.490
You boys shouldn't
make fun of your teacher.

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:04.500
Then at least tell us
what kind of guy you like!

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:07.970
Let's see. He'd have to
be a strong, powerful man.

00:06:08.070 --> 00:06:09.270
Um, uh...

00:06:09.370 --> 00:06:11.900
T-Thanks for saving me...

00:06:15.380 --> 00:06:18.470
I am Furinkan High School's
most puissant soul.

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:20.520
You shall date with me!

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:24.780
To think I've already
charmed the new teacher.

00:06:24.890 --> 00:06:27.190
What a heartless
individual I am.

00:06:27.290 --> 00:06:30.450
Very well.
Shall we begin our date?

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:38.300
I have no strength...

00:06:39.240 --> 00:06:41.290
Try again sometime.

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:44.310
As long as she's
got that trick...

00:06:44.410 --> 00:06:46.310
...we don't stand
a chance with her.

00:06:46.410 --> 00:06:48.380
Miss Hinako!

00:06:49.350 --> 00:06:50.610
What is it?

00:06:50.710 --> 00:06:52.540
Could I talk with
you alone for a sec?

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:54.140
That darn Ranma!

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:58.210
He's trying to sink his
fangs into older women, too?

00:06:58.320 --> 00:07:00.080
Are you gonna stand
for this, Akane!?

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:03.060
Ranma's making moves on
another woman again!

00:07:03.590 --> 00:07:06.320
It's okay. They're
teacher and student.

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:08.400
Nothing could possibly happen.

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:10.330
You're so naive, Akane.

00:07:10.430 --> 00:07:11.530
Nabiki?

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:14.130
The fatal pattern of love woven
between teacher and student!

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:16.500
The sweet immorality!

00:07:17.070 --> 00:07:22.100
An aphrodisiac once tasted,
soon destroys both souls!

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:24.910
N-Nonsense.

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:26.850
This is it!

00:07:26.950 --> 00:07:28.880
All I have to do is
master that technique...

00:07:28.990 --> 00:07:31.040
...and I can beat
the old goat!

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:32.450
Mr. Saotome, wait up!

00:07:32.790 --> 00:07:35.620
I'm pooped! Let's take a rest.

00:07:37.460 --> 00:07:38.590
She's a kid again!

00:07:38.690 --> 00:07:41.560
Don't be rude!
I'm an adult!

00:07:42.030 --> 00:07:43.430
Somethin' to do
with your trick?

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:46.630
"Trick"? You mean the
Happo Five-yen Satsu?

00:07:46.740 --> 00:07:48.700
Yeah, that's it!
That "Five-yen" thing!

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:52.700
I'd give just about anythin'
if you'd just show me...

00:07:52.980 --> 00:07:55.500
I get thirsty after I run.

00:07:56.480 --> 00:07:58.210
I guess so.

00:08:02.490 --> 00:08:06.180
So, Teach, about
that Happo Five-yen...

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:09.260
Step right up!
Get your balloons!

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:10.850
H-Hey, wait a minute...!

00:08:12.860 --> 00:08:14.920
I'm sorry.
You were saying...?

00:08:15.030 --> 00:08:18.360
Well, about that
Happo Five-yen thing...

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:31.000
Isn't he generous?

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:34.020
And he's never even
bought me a can of juice!

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:37.750
Teach, can you tell
me about it now?

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:40.050
Tell you what?

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:42.920
Can't you remember ANYTHING!?

00:08:47.900 --> 00:08:50.420
You y-yelled at me...!

00:08:50.530 --> 00:08:53.500
I-I'm sorry.
I shouldn't have...

00:08:54.670 --> 00:08:55.930
Whaddya think you're doing!?

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:57.440
What was that for!?

00:08:57.540 --> 00:08:59.940
I'm just tryin' to find
out the teacher's secrets...

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:03.940
"The teacher's secrets"...
You PERVERT!

00:09:04.550 --> 00:09:08.240
Gee! You've got a battle aura!
Are you a delinquent?

00:09:08.350 --> 00:09:10.250
No! Don't get mad, Akane!

00:09:10.350 --> 00:09:11.380
Do you think...

00:09:11.490 --> 00:09:12.980
...I can watch this
without getting mad!?

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:13.750
Ryoga!?

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:16.290
Fool! You're
engaged to Akane!

00:09:16.390 --> 00:09:18.990
You DARE put the moves
on another woman!?

00:09:19.100 --> 00:09:20.120
I won't allow it!

00:09:20.430 --> 00:09:24.090
You're suddenly picking fights!
You must be a delinquent!

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:25.390
Uh-oh.

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:27.440
"Delinquent"?
It's just that he...

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:28.870
Good Girl Exercise #1!

00:09:28.970 --> 00:09:30.700
Malice! Evil!
Illness! Pain! Magic!

00:09:31.510 --> 00:09:32.410
W-What is she...!?

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:34.740
Is that five-yen piece
the source of her power?

00:09:35.180 --> 00:09:37.040
Happo Five-yen Satsu!

00:09:43.590 --> 00:09:45.750
That's mine!

00:09:45.860 --> 00:09:48.050
My five-yen piece!

00:09:51.930 --> 00:09:56.920
With this, the technique that
defeated the old man is mine!

00:09:58.430 --> 00:09:59.730
Right!

00:09:59.840 --> 00:10:02.030
Bummed! Bad!

00:10:02.140 --> 00:10:04.330
Sick!

00:10:05.110 --> 00:10:06.900
Hurt!

00:10:09.410 --> 00:10:12.470
I dunno how to use it...!

00:10:12.580 --> 00:10:16.040
You could never use
the Happo Five-yen Satsu.

00:10:16.150 --> 00:10:18.520
I know that voice...
Old man, where are you!?

00:10:18.620 --> 00:10:20.820
I'm right here...

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:27.220
What're you supposed
to be? Waste paper?

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:31.490
Ranma. The secret of Happo
Five-yen Satsu isn't the coin.

00:10:31.600 --> 00:10:34.800
It's in her
unique metabolism!

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:37.470
She absorbs battle auras!

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:39.470
"Absorbs battle auras"?

00:10:39.580 --> 00:10:43.980
Yes! The Happo Five-yen Satsu
absorbs an opponent's aura...

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:47.950
...rendering them
incapable of battle!

00:10:48.050 --> 00:10:49.920
When she changes?

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:51.250
She's consumed your aura.

00:10:51.320 --> 00:10:52.450
"Consumed my aura"?

00:10:52.560 --> 00:10:57.550
Defeat the woman, for the sake
of Anything-Goes Martial Arts!

00:10:58.130 --> 00:11:02.330
If you don't, you
will surely be cursed!

00:11:02.570 --> 00:11:04.830
B-But how can I do it?

00:11:06.440 --> 00:11:07.600
I confer this upon you.

00:11:08.570 --> 00:11:09.970
Hey, this is a...!

00:11:10.840 --> 00:11:14.900
I'm so sorry.
I mistook your intentions.

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:19.140
Naww...
T'weren't nothin'...

00:11:20.350 --> 00:11:23.150
Miss Hinako, Ryoga's not
a delinquent! He's honest.

00:11:23.520 --> 00:11:27.110
He's kind, trustworthy, the kind
of guy who's always considerate!

00:11:27.220 --> 00:11:29.190
Akane!

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:32.750
It's Ranma who's the
irresponsible one.

00:11:33.300 --> 00:11:36.160
She's right! Ranma's
the one at fault!

00:11:36.570 --> 00:11:40.060
He's got an incredible
fiancee like Akane...

00:11:40.170 --> 00:11:43.830
But he's always chasing after
other women! He's a Casanova!

00:11:43.940 --> 00:11:48.600
He's a coward who'll do
anything to win a fight.

00:11:48.710 --> 00:11:51.200
He's cheap, vulgar,
stupid, and rude!

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:54.610
And there's more! He's a cross-
dresser who goes around in drag!

00:11:54.720 --> 00:11:55.980
I understand.

00:11:56.090 --> 00:11:58.880
Ranma is the
true delinquent.

00:11:58.990 --> 00:12:03.760
He did steal my money.
He needs to be punished.

00:12:08.130 --> 00:12:08.960
What's she...

00:12:09.070 --> 00:12:12.430
Miss Hinako? Pardon
me for saying so...

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:14.770
Yes, Miss Tendo?

00:12:14.870 --> 00:12:18.470
You've got bean paste
all over your face.

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:21.400
It's all gone.

00:12:35.290 --> 00:12:36.660
Was this it?

00:12:38.360 --> 00:12:40.920
Paging freshman
Ranma Saotome.

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:45.490
Please report immediately
to the Conference Room.

00:12:45.740 --> 00:12:47.930
That was quick.

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:52.670
Look.

00:12:52.780 --> 00:12:53.740
Something's up.

00:12:53.840 --> 00:12:55.170
We can't let this slide...

00:12:55.280 --> 00:12:57.110
Let's go see.

00:12:59.150 --> 00:13:00.950
Akane, let's go too.

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:02.570
No thanks.

00:13:02.690 --> 00:13:04.880
Couldn't care less.

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:11.830
What d'ya wanna
talk about, Teach?

00:13:12.090 --> 00:13:16.760
Ranma, yesterday you took
my most valued possession.

00:13:16.870 --> 00:13:18.700
Her most valued
possession!?

00:13:18.800 --> 00:13:19.860
Valued possession?

00:13:19.970 --> 00:13:21.700
Valued possession?
Valued possession?

00:13:21.800 --> 00:13:22.700
Valued?
Valued?

00:13:22.810 --> 00:13:25.300
That jerk!
What'd he do to her!?

00:13:25.410 --> 00:13:31.280
Took your... Come on! It was
just five yen, Miss Hinako.

00:13:31.380 --> 00:13:33.410
Just five yen...
But it is five yen...

00:13:33.520 --> 00:13:38.280
And I punish those
who don't value money!

00:13:39.660 --> 00:13:41.650
She's gonna try to
absorb my battle aura!

00:13:41.760 --> 00:13:46.020
Defense #1: The Happo Five-yen
Satsu drains one's battle aura.

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:49.830
Countermeasure:
Never initiate an attack!

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:54.390
So long as I don't emit a
battle aura, she can't touch me!

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:55.830
I gotta stay cool!

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:00.030
You're good!

00:14:00.140 --> 00:14:02.300
Good Girl Exercise #2!

00:14:02.410 --> 00:14:04.310
Happo Fifty-yen Satsu!

00:14:04.410 --> 00:14:06.610
What!?

00:14:14.090 --> 00:14:15.680
What power!

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:19.060
I'm not lettin' out any battle
aura, but she's suckin' me dry!

00:14:22.300 --> 00:14:26.960
Even when you do nothing at all,
I can absorb your aura!

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:29.590
I gotta do somethin'...!

00:14:30.570 --> 00:14:32.800
Defense #2: Use the
absorption block points!

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:36.570
Apply pressure simultaneously
to the five points...

00:14:36.680 --> 00:14:39.940
And you cancel the Happo
Five-yen Satsu technique!

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:42.710
Surrender!

00:14:42.820 --> 00:14:46.980
The points are on the back
and chest! I have to try!

00:14:49.760 --> 00:14:51.950
You're mine now!

00:14:53.730 --> 00:14:55.720
Miss Hinako!

00:15:03.010 --> 00:15:05.740
A-A-Animal!

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:07.470
You... You brute!

00:15:07.740 --> 00:15:11.910
Idiot! You're wrong! I had no
choice after Teach attacked me!

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:13.480
"Had no choice."
Well, then...

00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:15.910
What's with the HAND!?

00:15:16.750 --> 00:15:17.910
Ranma, you pervert!

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:19.390
Oh my god!

00:15:20.760 --> 00:15:21.850
Ranma!

00:15:22.530 --> 00:15:25.150
Wait! Akane, it's not what you
think! It's a misunderstandin'!

00:15:25.560 --> 00:15:27.790
Making excuses while
you're still touching her...

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:30.090
You PERVERT!

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:35.370
It's only natural.

00:15:35.470 --> 00:15:40.000
Locked in a room with a hot
teacher, anything could happen.

00:15:43.310 --> 00:15:44.010
Bye-bye!

00:15:44.110 --> 00:15:45.340
See ya!

00:15:46.150 --> 00:15:47.780
Goodbye, Miss Hinako!

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:49.320
Goodbye.

00:15:53.560 --> 00:15:57.360
She's a dangerous woman!
I've gotta stop her quick!

00:15:57.730 --> 00:16:02.360
With a frontal attack, she'll get
my aura AND call me a pervert!

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:04.830
That means I'll have to
strike from the rear. Now!

00:16:06.300 --> 00:16:08.030
Happo Five-yen Satsu!

00:16:12.510 --> 00:16:14.700
N-No good...

00:16:17.180 --> 00:16:19.270
How disgusting!

00:16:20.350 --> 00:16:21.580
He's a molester!

00:16:21.680 --> 00:16:23.020
I can't believe it!

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:25.090
Hey, come check it out!

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:27.810
I always knew
Ranma was a creep.

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:29.690
Men are such wolves.

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:30.880
Not once, but twice!

00:16:30.990 --> 00:16:33.090
Can't lie your way
through this one!

00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:37.890
To brazenly fondle the charms
of a teacher in broad daylight!

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:40.160
Ranma Saotome,
you shan't escape my wrath!

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:42.600
Kuno-Baby,
you're just jealous.

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:45.300
N-No! I can explain...!

00:16:46.680 --> 00:16:50.340
It's all my fault!
I'm just too appealing!

00:16:51.310 --> 00:16:54.710
Everyone! Mr. Saotome is
a very lecherous young man!

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:57.010
Cut it out!

00:16:59.860 --> 00:17:01.910
Say, did you
hear about Ranma?

00:17:02.020 --> 00:17:03.620
I was there!

00:17:03.730 --> 00:17:05.790
Ranma's a molester?

00:17:05.890 --> 00:17:08.690
I guess his body isn't the
only weird thing about him!

00:17:08.800 --> 00:17:10.460
He's a weirdo!

00:17:10.570 --> 00:17:11.690
He scares me!

00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:14.000
Yucky!

00:17:17.540 --> 00:17:22.770
Damn! Now all I can do is finish
her off and clear my name!

00:17:22.880 --> 00:17:28.150
I gotta get to her block points
without doin' anythin' perverted!

00:17:29.220 --> 00:17:30.150
Oh yeah.

00:17:33.660 --> 00:17:36.780
I wonder what Ranma's
up to this time.

00:17:36.890 --> 00:17:39.090
You got me.

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:43.150
Akane, I know Ranma told
you to trust him, but...

00:17:43.270 --> 00:17:44.820
How can he say that now?

00:17:47.770 --> 00:17:52.300
Why did you call me out here?
Are you really Mr. Saotome?

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:56.570
I understand your confusion,
but I am Ranma Saotome.

00:17:56.680 --> 00:18:00.950
Miss Hinako, I'm goin' to hit
your absorption block points!

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:03.990
So you better
be ready for it!

00:18:04.090 --> 00:18:07.820
Remember that two girls touchin'
each other ain't perverted!

00:18:08.090 --> 00:18:10.920
Not only are you a
womanizer and a pervert!

00:18:11.030 --> 00:18:14.590
On top of that, you're a
cross-dresser! You bad boy!

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:16.360
Happo...

00:18:16.970 --> 00:18:19.160
Think again!

00:18:21.570 --> 00:18:23.730
Happo Fifty-yen...

00:18:29.140 --> 00:18:33.910
You can't beat me without your
pocket full of yen, can you?

00:18:34.950 --> 00:18:36.710
Miss Hinako,
en garde!

00:18:36.820 --> 00:18:38.220
No! Stop it!

00:18:38.320 --> 00:18:41.720
H-Hey, wait a minute,
whaddya think you're doin'!?

00:18:41.820 --> 00:18:43.620
If you get at
those block points...

00:18:43.730 --> 00:18:47.560
...we'll never see that
incredible bod again!

00:18:47.660 --> 00:18:50.360
This is no time
for that, you idiots!

00:18:54.600 --> 00:18:56.870
What is she up to now?

00:18:56.970 --> 00:18:57.730
No!

00:18:57.840 --> 00:19:00.140
Happo Basket-hoop Satsu!

00:19:03.510 --> 00:19:04.910
Watch out!

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:05.910
Ranma! You're...

00:19:06.010 --> 00:19:07.310
...using US as a shield!

00:19:09.950 --> 00:19:11.250
No fair, Ranma!

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:13.410
I hate you!

00:19:13.520 --> 00:19:15.050
That was a dirty trick.

00:19:17.090 --> 00:19:22.290
So long as I have a round object,
I can always absorb auras.

00:19:22.400 --> 00:19:25.200
She can't go on
stealin' people's energy!

00:19:25.800 --> 00:19:28.330
Happo No-yen Coin Return!

00:19:35.240 --> 00:19:37.080
Hurray! A bull's-eye!

00:19:37.750 --> 00:19:40.110
She's attacking with
the energy she's drained!

00:19:40.420 --> 00:19:42.280
She just keeps coming
up with new tricks!

00:19:42.380 --> 00:19:43.610
She's passable.

00:19:43.720 --> 00:19:45.380
Ranma and Hinako.

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:49.550
I never wished to see my two
disciples in a deadly duel.

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:50.890
How tragic!

00:19:51.190 --> 00:19:52.390
What did you say!?

00:19:52.490 --> 00:19:53.650
What's that mean?

00:19:53.760 --> 00:19:58.790
It started ten years ago.
Hinako has likely forgotten it by now.

00:19:58.900 --> 00:20:02.600
I found the young Hinako
at some monkey hospital.

00:20:02.700 --> 00:20:03.860
Some Monkey Hospital

00:20:04.010 --> 00:20:06.940
Is that so?
A frail constitution, eh?

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:09.140
That's right.

00:20:09.510 --> 00:20:14.070
Okay. I'll show you an exercise
that will perk you right up!

00:20:14.180 --> 00:20:16.050
Thanks, Mister!

00:20:16.590 --> 00:20:19.490
I applied pressure to
her absorption points...

00:20:19.590 --> 00:20:21.750
And taught her
therapeutic exercises.

00:20:21.860 --> 00:20:24.190
Good Girl Exercise #1!

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:29.820
Then one day, all our
hard work paid off!

00:20:29.930 --> 00:20:30.990
It's a panty thief!

00:20:31.230 --> 00:20:33.500
Wait! You dirty old man!

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:34.830
Now, Hinako!

00:20:34.940 --> 00:20:36.800
Good Girl Exercise #1!

00:20:36.910 --> 00:20:40.070
Malice! Evil!
Illness! Pain! Magic!

00:20:42.780 --> 00:20:47.270
As she absorbed the nurses' auras,
she kept getting healthier!

00:20:49.820 --> 00:20:52.410
Let's do it again
tomorrow, Hinako?

00:20:52.820 --> 00:20:57.950
All I wanted was for her to get
better! How tragic that she...

00:20:58.890 --> 00:21:02.160
So this is all your fault!

00:21:02.260 --> 00:21:04.130
Never a dull moment
with you, Gramps.

00:21:04.570 --> 00:21:06.560
I'd better end this.

00:21:08.170 --> 00:21:10.140
Happo Fifty-yen...

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:14.840
Oh no, he's gone!
Where'd he go!?

00:21:15.380 --> 00:21:20.180
I can't get near her!
I've gotta think of somethin'!

00:21:20.280 --> 00:21:22.750
Mr. Saotome!
I found you!

00:21:23.290 --> 00:21:24.550
Uh-oh!

00:21:24.650 --> 00:21:26.850
Come back here!

00:21:32.260 --> 00:21:36.060
Forgive me, Akane. Although the
ends may justify the means...

00:21:36.160 --> 00:21:41.260
I tricked Miss Hinako into
making mincemeat of Ranma.

00:21:41.700 --> 00:21:44.600
A despicable act for
a martial artist!

00:21:44.710 --> 00:21:46.970
I must do my penance
on this far-off mountain.

00:21:47.080 --> 00:21:49.070
Hey!

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:52.510
Come 'n' get me!

00:21:52.610 --> 00:21:55.710
Stop running away,
you delinquent!

00:21:58.520 --> 00:22:01.050
That was Ranma
and that teacher!

00:22:01.160 --> 00:22:03.820
Wait up! I'm the
one who'll defeat Ranma!

00:22:04.330 --> 00:22:05.850
Come back here!

00:22:07.230 --> 00:22:09.790
I hate havin' to run away,
but I got no choice!

00:22:09.970 --> 00:22:13.830
Only bad boys run away!
Happo Fifty-yen Satsu!

00:22:18.840 --> 00:22:22.470
I can barely keep up with him.
Happo Fifty-yen Satsu!

00:22:24.710 --> 00:22:26.180
Watch out!
She's absorbing everybody!

00:22:26.280 --> 00:22:27.870
She's comin' this way!
Run for it!

00:22:27.980 --> 00:22:30.450
Damn! Akane,
Nabiki, RUN!

00:22:32.190 --> 00:22:33.090
Akane!

00:22:37.190 --> 00:22:39.390
Ryoga!

00:22:42.430 --> 00:22:43.560
Ryoga!

00:22:43.670 --> 00:22:44.930
Kuno-Baby.
Thank you.

00:22:45.330 --> 00:22:49.740
Now look what you did! I'm not
hidin' anymore! Come at me!

00:22:49.870 --> 00:22:52.240
So you're prepared
for defeat.

00:22:52.340 --> 00:22:56.510
Then, here goes.
Happo No-yen Coin Return!

00:23:03.990 --> 00:23:06.720
Mr. Saotome!
This is the end!

00:23:07.920 --> 00:23:10.450
I'm done for.
Game over!

00:23:15.130 --> 00:23:17.000
That's it!

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:21.270
You want my
battle aura!?

00:23:21.370 --> 00:23:23.100
Then take it!

00:23:23.210 --> 00:23:25.670
Happo Basket-hoop Satsu!

00:23:30.310 --> 00:23:31.210
You mean...!

00:23:33.750 --> 00:23:34.740
Oh, NO!

00:23:35.280 --> 00:23:38.050
Battle Aura
Absorption Block!

00:23:57.140 --> 00:23:59.270
You win, Mr. Saotome.

00:23:59.370 --> 00:24:03.110
Of all my students, none
have resisted as hard as you.

00:24:03.210 --> 00:24:04.300
Miss Hinako...

00:24:04.410 --> 00:24:06.010
You've done well, Ranma!

00:24:06.110 --> 00:24:07.340
You did it, Ranma!

00:24:07.450 --> 00:24:09.940
We can't call you
a pervert anymore.

00:24:10.050 --> 00:24:11.040
It was nothin'.

00:24:11.150 --> 00:24:16.060
And if you press the block
points every day, for a month...

00:24:16.160 --> 00:24:19.490
She'll never absorb
battle auras again!

00:24:19.590 --> 00:24:21.060
What was that!?

00:24:21.160 --> 00:24:22.490
Every day?

00:24:22.600 --> 00:24:26.330
You need to repeat
it before results can be...

00:24:28.340 --> 00:24:31.700
That's right!
The game has just begun!

00:24:32.940 --> 00:24:36.100
Let's do this again
tomorrow, Mr. Saotome.

00:24:36.210 --> 00:24:38.370
He has to go
through this every day!?

00:24:38.480 --> 00:24:39.380
It's hopeless.

00:24:39.480 --> 00:24:42.510
Every day, huh? Goody.

00:24:44.190 --> 00:24:47.380
It'll be another
beautiful day tomorrow!

00:24:47.490 --> 00:24:49.680
Whoosh, whoosh.

00:24:50.490 --> 00:24:52.690
Rustle, rustle.

00:24:54.060 --> 00:24:56.390
How did I get
caught up in this?

00:24:56.500 --> 00:24:59.730
And so, everyone,
Until next time...
